From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bpereira <bpereira@cloudflare.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 19:47:10 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Allocate and pack measurement cache slots only when needed

Most nodes never measure more than once, yet each carried a full inline
array of measurement slots. Box the slots on first store, and keep only
the populated prefix without per-slot options. Lookup order and the
second-chance clock indices are preserved, so cache hits and evictions
are unchanged.

Signed-off-by: bpereira <bpereira@cloudflare.com>
---
